uco-marking:GranularMarking a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "A granular marking is a grouping of characteristics unique to specification of marking definitions (restrictions, permissions, and other guidance for how data can be used and shared) that apply to particular portions of a particular UCO object." ;
